# Two conflicts {a,b} and {b,c}; minimal repairs are {b}, {a,c}.
@prefix : <urn:howl:alignment:test:> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
:A a owl:Class ; owl:disjointWith :D .
:E a owl:Class ; owl:disjointWith :D .
:D a owl:Class .
:X a owl:Class .
